From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xKr4kn <xKr4kn@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:30:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t7000: Enable internal storage on the iPad mini 4

The T7000 ANS nodes are disabled in the SoC files. The iPad mini 4
(J97) uses the same ANS1 storage processor as the iPod touch 6 and the
iPad Air 2. Enable the ANS block and its mailbox, and keep ps_ans on as
on the N102: the boot loader starts the firmware and iOS never powers it
down.

Signed-off-by: xKr4kn <xKr4kn@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-j97.dts | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-j97.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-j97.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-j97.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-j97.dts
@@ -16,4 +16,16 @@
 /* ADT uart2/wlan module-instance, for brcmfmac's firmware selection */
 &wifi0 {
 	brcm,board-type = "apple,zinfandelb";
 };
+
+&ans {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ans_mbox {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_ans {
+	apple,always-on;
+};
